extMapHash":2004729290,"text":"白フラも私と道を共に歩むなら、これぐらい分かってもらわないと困るワ。","nextNodeIds":[733120317]},{"nodeId":733120317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":994428826,"text":"これらの「霊谷木」は大地を浸蝕した穢れと戦った花霊が、最後の力を振り絞って変身した姿なのヨ。","nextNodeIds":[733120318]},{"nodeId":733120318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":909129226,"text":"力が尽きて本来の姿さえ維持できなくなって、穢れに触れたせいで花海にも拒まれてしまったノ。","nextNodeIds":[733120319]},{"nodeId":733120319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":692912890,"text":"言い伝えによると、かつてはスケプティック団による浄罪の儀式を経れば、彼女たちも再び「甘露花海」に戻ることができたそうヨ。","nextNodeIds":[733120320]},{"nodeId":733120320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":1710031490,"text":"でも今となっては、スケプティック団にその儀式を執り行える人はもういナイ。辛うじて、霊谷木が枯れて死んじゃったりしないように保つのが精一杯でしょうネ。","nextNodeIds":[733120321]},{"nodeId":733120321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":1262250610,"text":"でも、それはむしろ彼女たちの苦しみを長引かせているだけヨ。今のままじゃ、きっと彼女たちに残されているのは、苦難に満ちた記憶にただ独りで耐える道だけだワ。","nextNodeIds":[733120322]},{"nodeId":733120322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":3409776466,"text":"花霊の使命を果たしたと言えど、それは無駄な犠牲。真の犠牲には程遠いワ…","nextNodeIds":[733120323,733120324]},{"nodeId":733120323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4180272506,"text":"助けないと。","nextNodeIds":[733120325]},{"nodeId":733120325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1528100274,"text":"うんうん！独りで苦痛に耐え続けるだけだなんて、可哀想すぎるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[733120326]},{"nodeId":733120326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":431561866,"text":"可哀想、デスって？白フラったら随分と弱気ネ。あわれみというのは、神鳥様もお持ちだった尊い品格ではあるけど、それだけじゃこの世界では生きていけないわヨ。","nextNodeIds":[733120327]},{"nodeId":733120327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":1534124514,"text":"ましてや、花霊にとっての最高の最期というのは、力尽きるまで邪悪な力と戦いぬくことヨ。それ以外なんて蛇足にすぎないワ。","nextNodeIds":[733120328]},{"nodeId":733120328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2970574026,"text":"う…でもそれはあくまでソルシュの考えであって、おまえも言ってたけど、もしかしたら本望じゃなかったかもしれないんだろ！","nextNodeIds":[733120329]},{"nodeId":733120329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":967234314,"text":"もしオイラだったら、こんな所より、花海に帰ってみんなと一緒にいたいって思うもんな…","nextNodeIds":[733120330]},{"nodeId":733120330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":4147000546,"text":"我ら花霊はそんなに軟弱な存在じゃないワ！","nextNodeIds":[733120331]},{"nodeId":733120331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20987,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":3095689474,"text":"ふん、まあ我が「謁賛主」までがそう言うのナラ…いいでしょう。とりあえず私が力で彼女を呼び覚まして、最期の声を聞かせてあげる。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":733120324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":32263618,"text":"救う方法はあるってことでしょ…","nextNodeIds":[733120325]},{"nodeId":733120307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3546612762,"text":"どこかに通じてるかも。","nextNodeIds":[733120308]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7331203,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7331202,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7330701","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["20987"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7331208,"order":4,"